<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <h2 style="color: #1a1a2e;">Verify your DocCraft email</h2>
  <p>Hi {{#if fullName}}{{fullName}}{{else}}there{{/if}},</p>
  <p>Use the code below to verify your email address. It expires in <strong>10 minutes</strong>.</p>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;">
    <span style="display: inline-block; background: #f4f4f8; border: 2px solid #6c63ff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 40px; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 10px; color: #1a1a2e;">{{token}}</span>
  </div>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">If you did not create a DocCraft account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</div>
